esponse\",\"enum\":[\"error\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"status\",\"error\"],\"type\":\"object\"}]}}},\"description\":\"Successful coordinate conversion\"}},\"securitySource\":\"unspecified\"}",
